WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:10.380
Findings lists everything raised against your systems, most serious first.

2
00:00:11.318 --> 00:00:19.659
The demo has none yet: its one fairness test passed. A failed check, a policy alert or a monitoring watch raises a finding here.

3
00:00:20.535 --> 00:00:28.130
Each finding opens with what was found, the suggested fix and its remediation tasks. It closes when the next check passes.
